  "prefLabel": "Ph 2005.03 Renewal Application Contents and When Filed",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 2005.03 Renewal Application Contents and When Filed.\n\n(a) Applications for renewal of a license to operate a 503B outsourcing facility shall consist of a completed renewal application form as described in Ph 2005.02 and the prescribed fee of $500.00.\n\n(b) Renewal applications as required pursuant to Ph 2005.01 shall be submitted to the board no later than the 15th day of June of every odd-numbered year.\n\nSource. #12336, eff 7-22-17; ss by #13117, eff 10-15-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
